OL,3,GNEWSARTE buildings evacuated after bomb
OL,4,Athreat email
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe headquarters of the Republic of
OL,7,FIreland's public service broadcaster,
OL,8,FRTE, has been evacuated following a
OL,9,Fbomb threat.
OL,11,FRTE News is reporting that the threat
OL,12,Fwas received via an email on Friday
OL,13,Fmorning.
OL,15,FStaff have left RTE buildings in
OL,16,FDonnybrook in Dublin and gardai (Irish
OL,17,Fpolice) are at the scene conducting
OL,18,Fsearches.
OL,20,FIn a statement, gardai said they were
OL,21,F"aware of a threat made against media
OL,22,Forganisations here and in Europe".
